      "number": 1,
      "leadSummary": "Historical development of organometallic chemistry, definitions and bond types, covalent (neutral) and ionic ligand classification models, the CBC framework, molecular orbital derivation of the 18-electron rule, sub-18-electron and super-18-electron complexes, 16-electron square planar d8 systems, electron counting in dinuclear clusters with metal-metal bonds and bridging ligands, and 3-center 2-electron bonding.",
