      "leadSummary": "Dewar-Chatt-Duncanson bonding model for alkene coordination, Zeise's salt, metallacyclopropanes, dynamic rotational barriers around metal-olefin bonds, 2-electron vs 4-electron alkyne donors, synthesis and electronic structure of eta3-allyl complexes, dynamic fluxionality and syn-anti exchange mechanisms, Davies-Green-Mingos (DGM) rules, and the Tsuji-Trost asymmetric allylic alkylation.",
