      "leadSummary": "Ligand substitution pathways (associative vs dissociative), kinetic trans-effect vs thermodynamic trans-influence in platinum complexes, concerted oxidative addition of non-polar substrates, polar oxidative addition via SN2 and radical pathways, microscopic reversibility in reductive elimination, bite-angle acceleration, 1,1-migratory insertion of carbon monoxide, 1,2-migratory insertion of alkenes into metal hydrides, and alpha- vs beta-hydride elimination mechanisms.",
