      "leadSummary": "Principles of homogeneous catalysis, turnover numbers and turnover frequencies, Wilkinson's catalyst hydrogenation mechanism and kinetics, asymmetric hydrogenation by Knowles and Noyori, the Halpern minor-isomer mechanism, industrial hydroformylation (the Oxo process) with cobalt and rhodium catalysts, regioselectivity engineering (linear vs branched), the Chauvin metallacyclobutane metathesis mechanism, Schrock vs Grubbs catalysts, RCM, ROMP, CM, and Z-selective metathesis.",
